      "message": "test(post): follow main's file-backed registry and lost Top Z air level\n\nlinuxcnc_post.rs: BUILTINS / MACHINES now hold AssetFile names\n(#2282); read the texts through builtin_post_text and\nbuiltin_machine_text.\n\nGoldens nc/linuxcnc/*: regenerated after main's 185a69f1e removed the\npass at the stock top Z for every dialect. Only those pass lines go;\nthe diff matches main's tormach goldens line for line.\n\nRefs #2303\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus <noreply@anthropic.com>",
